5,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I believe we should examine the operational capacity before committing to a plan. I'll start with the staffing records.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Takumi,,We always repeat the same mistakes. I'm going to check the old records to see what actually failed before.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I am interested in the administrative hurdles and the physical constraints of the older infrastructure.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... I think... maybe we should look at the long-term costs. I'll check the ledger and the contractor fees.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,Yay! A mystery! I want to know where the time actually goes! I'll check the audits and the crowd counts!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke, costs are important, but not if the service is impossible to staff.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"Exactly. If we don't look at the past, we're just guessing.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Toshio,,A balanced approach is best. Let us see what the data reveals.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,Sorry... I just... I worry about the hidden debts.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Don't be so gloomy, Daisuke! Let's find some secrets!","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
