35,2,1,talk,Victoria,,It seems my concerns were valid. The staffing levels for the late-turn pool are dangerously low.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"I found that some of our ""new"" ideas were actually tried eight years ago and worked. Why did we stop?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The administrative approvals for some routes are far more complex than the drawings suggest.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,The... the ledger is worrying. We are paying too much to contractors and not enough for the actual network.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Sakura,,Guess what! The crowds aren't the real problem! It's the waiting for connections that's eating all the time!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Takumi, if those pilots worked, we must ensure we have the crew to sustain them this time.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Takumi,,I agree. But we can't just throw money at it if the system is broken.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Toshio,,We must also consider that the physical state of the pre-war shells makes delivery dates unreliable.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I'm afraid that if we pick the most expensive plan, we'll just be paying contractor fees for years.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"But if we just fix the crowds, we're ignoring the real time-wasters! We need a plan that fixes the connections!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"We need a plan that is realistic. If it requires more late-turn staff, it will fail.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Takumi,,I'm not letting us ignore the evidence from the pilots. We need a plan that builds on what worked.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Toshio,,A plan that avoids the pre-war shells or accounts for their instability would be the most reliable.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think we should avoid any plan that increases the long-term contractor commitments.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"Let's pick the one that makes the trip fastest for everyone, not just the one that looks good on a map!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Victoria,,Let us wait for the candidates to be presented. We can then match them against these realities.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"Fine. But I'm not voting for a ""new"" idea that's just a recycled failure.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Toshio,,Agreed. We shall evaluate them based on the risks we've identified.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,Okay... I'll try to be... objective.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Sakura,,This is getting exciting! I can't wait to see the plans!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
